--- !u!114 &617199436
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 617199435}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b10d590d6851e4c8d8218c0ea1ff66fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WelcomeStoryManager
  welcomePanel: {fileID: 883198641}
  storyText: {fileID: 432824491}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1563274589}
  prevButton: {fileID: 918732812}
  playerCharacter: {fileID: 0}
  storySlides:
  - 'If you are reading this, it means you''re in.


    Good.


    I don''t know
    who you are,

    or why you are the one left

    when the others are not.'
  - 'This tower is no ordinary place. Every floor holds something, and perhaps the
    answers you didn''t even know you were looking for.


    Don''t rush. Observe
    first. This tower has been waiting for you...'
  - 'You will find other entities here.


    Some can be trusted.

    Some cannot.

    Some...
    I''m not even sure myself.


    Trust your instincts.

    Read every note you
    find.'
  - 'There is a way out of this tower. It depends on how far you are willing to look
    and how much you are willing to truly understand.


    Your choice.

    Always
    your choice.'
  - 'I cannot tell you

    what you will find at the top.


    But I can tell you
    this:

    The world outside has stopped. You haven''t!


    Maybe there is
    a reason for that.'
  typeSpeed: 0.05
